      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "process Process_ThemeUIReview",
      "prov:value": "This process was post-MVP until then — started by \"MVP accepted\" and called from `crdm-deliver.bpmn` on the edge out of stakeholder acceptance, reviewing what had already shipped. That call is gone. It is now called from `ingest-theme.bpmn`."
    },
    {
      "@id": "processes/ui/theme-ui-review.bpmn#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "lane Lane_Agent",
      "prov:value": "Four measured passes into R_Judge — inventory, accessibility, branding, locales — each one required to MEASURE rather than assert, because an automated pass alone missed three defects a rendered look caught outright."
    },
    {
      "@id": "processes/ui/theme-ui-review.bpmn#provenance-4",
