      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "task R_Judge",
      "prov:value": "Three defects in the landing board — a selector matching nothing, a crop cutting the subject, a fade wrong in both directions — were invisible to a clean build, a passing suite and every gate, and were found only by rendering the page and looking."
